 or video of your project (optional)",rule4:"Submit your post link to get rewarded",rule5:"48-hour minimum posting period required"},J$={label:"Submit your link",button:"Submit",placeholderDefault:"Paste and submit your post link",placeholderRewardLimit:"Reward limit reached",placeholderSubmissionLimit:"Submission Limit Reached",terminatedTip:"The campaign has been terminated"},Z$={title:"Submit list",platformTwitter:"X(Twitter)",platformLinkedIn:"LinkedIn"},_$={pending:"Pending",underReview:"Under Review",approved:"Approved"},$$={awaitingSubmission:"Awaiting Submission",pleaseWait:"Please wait for review",creditsAdded:"+250 Credits"},eee={alreadySubmitted:"You have already submitted a link from this platform",linkExists:"Each link can only be submitted once",invalidUrl:"Please provide the link from the respective platform"},tee={title:"Submission Rules",rule1:"250 credits awarded instantly upon approval of each social media share link",rule2:"Only one reward per social platform. Do not resubmit the same platform",rule3:"Please allow up to 2 minutes for link verification"},nee={template1:`🚀 Just built {projectname} with {raaddyaccount}! It's amazing how fast you can turn an idea into reality.
    Check it out: {projectsharelink} 

    Highly recommend giving it a go: {referrallink} 

    #ReaddyAI #BuildFaster #NoCode 
`,template2:`My mind is blown! 🤯 {raaddyaccount} just auto-generated my {projectname} for me. The future of building is here. 

    See what it made: {projectsharelink} 

    Want to try? {referrallink} 

    #ReaddyAI #AI #Innovation`,template3:`Shipped {projectname} in record time with {raaddyaccount}. Idea to done, just like that.
    Preview: {projectsharelink} 

    Join me and build something: {referrallink} 

    #ReaddyAI #Productivity #Maker`,template4:`Got ideas but no dev team? Same. So I used {raaddyaccount} to bring {projectname} to life myself.
    See how: {projectsharelink} 

    Start building: {referrallink} 

    #ReaddyAI #ProblemSolving #Startups`,template5:`So proud of this! With a little help from {raaddyaccount}, I've just launched {projectname} into the world.
    Explore it: {projectsharelink} 

    Create your own: {referrallink} 

    #ReaddyAI #BuildingInPublic #IndieHacker`,template6:`No heavy lifting required. {raaddyaccount} just built {projectname} for me while I sipped my coffee. ☕️
    Peek at it: {projectsharelink} 

    Build effortlessly: {referrallink} 

    #ReaddyAI #NoCode #Automation`,template7:`We're building at lightspeed now. Just used {raaddyaccount} to launch {projectname} with the team.
    Live here: {projectsharelink} 

    Join the movement: {referrallink} 

    #ReaddyAI #Collaboration #FutureOfWork`,template8:`Built {projectname}. Used {raaddyaccount}. Done.
    Check it: {projectsharelink} 

    Your turn: {referrallink} 

    #ReaddyAI #BuildFaster #Tools`,template9:`Stumbled upon something awesome! {raaddyaccount} just whipped up my {projectname} for me. It's that easy.
    Have a look: {projectsharelink} 

    See how it works: {referrallink} 

    #ReaddyAI #GameChanger #NoCode`,template10:`Remember when building stuff took forever? Not anymore. {raaddyaccount} just built my {projectname} in a snap.
    The proof: {projectsharelink} 

    Cut your build time: {referrallink} 

