o",exportFigma:"Export to Figma",collectLeads:"Collect leads with 20 voice minutes and 200 chat messages",creditsPerMonth:"{credits} credits per month",exportAndDownload:"Export to Figma & download code",publishWithDomain:"Publish with custom domain",leadsCapture:"Leads capture via Readdy Agent {voiceLimit} minutes of Voice & {chatLimit} Chats per month",formSubmissions:"50 form submissions per month"},yearly:{customDomain:"Free Custom Domain for 1 Year",freeDomain:"Get 1 free custom domain for a year"}},pro:{description:"Unlock higher limits and high-quality image model for all your projects.",monthly:{everythingStarter:"Everything in Starter ",higherLimits:"Higher AI Limits than Starter Plan",moreProjects:"More Projects",collectLeads:"Collect leads with 80 voice minutes and 800 chat messages",creditsPerMonth:"{credits} credits per month",unlimitedProjects:"Unlimited projects",leadsCapture:"Leads capture via Readdy Agent {voiceLimit} minutes of Voice & {chatLimit} Chats per month",formSubmissions:"10,000 form submissions per month"}},pro80:{monthly:{everythingPro:"Everything in Pro-40 ",moreCredit:"More Credit, Extra Output",moreProjects:"More Projects"}}},dhe={starter:"For beginners & light use",pro:"For growing solo users & side projects",pro80:"For projects with higher standard requirements.",pro120:"For frequent use & expanding projects",pro160:"For scaling businesses & complex projects",pro200:"For large workloads & demanding needs"},phe={title:"Subscription",upgrade:"Upgrade",undoSwitchPlan:"Undo Switch Plan",resetOn:"Your monthly credits will reset on",switchedToFree:"You've switched to the Free plan. Your current subscription will stay active until",switchedToPlan:"You've switched to the {plan} plan. It will take effect after your current subscription ends on",billedInterval:"Your account is billed {interval} and the next payment is due to"},fhe={manage:"Manage Billing & Invoices",yearly:"Yearly",monthly:"Monthly",popular:"Popular",perMonth:"/ Month",including:"Including",credits:"Credits",collectLeadsWithVoiceAndChat:"Collect leads with {voiceLimit} voice minutes and {chatLimit} chat messages",save:"Save ${amount}",everythingInStarterPlus:"Everything in Starter, plus:"},hhe={domainTitle:"Enjoy a FREE Domain for 1 Year",domainSubtitle:"SUBSCRIBE YEARLY",subscribeTitle:"Subscribe now and get",subscribeCredits:"1200 CREDITS"},mhe={monthlyCreditsLeft:"Monthly Credits Left",remainingTotalCredits:"Remaining / Total Credits",creditsResetOn:"Credits reset on",creditsLeft:"Credits Left",totalCredits:"Total Credits",resetOn:"Reset on",plan:"Plan"},ghe={title:"Frequently Asked Questions",creditsWhat:{question:"What are credits and how do they work?",answer:"Credits are your design currency in Readdy. Each generation or edit costs 25 credits. For a detailed breakdown of how credits are used across different features, please refer to Credit Consumption Rules. <br>Credits refresh automatically every month for all users, whether you're on a monthly or annual plan. The exact refresh date depends on your subscription start date and can be viewed on your Subscription page."},creditsRunOut:{question:"What happens when I run out of credits?",answer:"When you use up all your available credits, you can upgrade to a higher subscription plan to receive more. If you're already on the highest tier, please contact us at hi{'@'}readdy.ai for additional credit options."},websiteAccess:{question:"Can my published website still be accessed if I cancel my subscription?",answer:"No. Once your subscription expires, your published website will no longer be accessible online. However, don't worry — your project will remain safely stored in your account, and you can republish it anytime after renewing your subscription."},planChange:{question:"Can I upgrade or downgrade my plan?",answer:"Yes, you can upgrade or downgrade your plan at any time.<br>Upgrades take effect immediately — depending on your situation, you may either pay the price difference or the full plan amount, and any unused portion from your previous plan will be refunded within seven business days. <br>Downgrades take effect at the start of the next billing cycle, so you'll continue to enjoy your current plan benefits until then."},invoices:{question:"Do you provide invoices?",answer:"Yes. All invoices can be viewed and downloaded as PDF files from your Subscription page, making it easy to keep track of your billing records."},companyInvoice:{question:"Can I subscribe and get an invoice under my company name?",answer:`Yes. When making a payment, simply check the "I'm purchasing as a business" option and fill in your company details. The invoice will then be issued under your company name automatically.`}},vhe={title:"Want to switch to {plan} {interval} plan?",subtitle:"Here is what will change if you switch",switchTo:"Switch to {plan}",stayOnPlan:"Stay on Current Plan",feedback:{title:"Why are you switching plan?",subtitle:"Help us understand how we can do better",selectPrompt:"Please select all that apply:",placeholder:"Please specify",budgetConsiderations:"Budget considerations (too expensive)",notEnoughValue:"Not getting enough value from current plan",notNeedManyCredits:"I don't need that many credits",other:"Other"},warning:{creditsDecrease:"Credit limit will decrease from {currentCredits} to {nextCredits} per month",projectsDecrease:"Project limit will decrease from unlimited to 10",voiceDecrease:"Leads capture via Readdy Voice Agent will decrease from {currentVoiceLimit} to {nextVoiceLimit} minutes per month",chatDecrease:"Leads capture via Readdy Chat Agent will decrease from {currentChatLimit} to {nextChatLimit} per month",formDecrease:"Form submission limit will decrease from 10,000 to 50 per month",loseYearlyDiscount:"Lose the 40% off yearly billing discount",priceChange:"Monthly subscribe price will change from ${currentPrice} to ${nextPrice}"},successMessage:"You've successfully switched to the {planName} {interval} plan.<br> Your curre